     <p style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;">
</p><p style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;text-indent: 0.29in;"><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">盛夏逐梦，启航新章！为帮助2026级高一新生尽快融入校园环境、适应高中学习生活，搭建家校共育桥梁，绍兴一中教育集团开展高一新生始业教育活动，为学子们的高中生涯拉开崭新序幕。</span></p><p style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;text-indent: 0.29in;"><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"></span></p><p><img src="/UploadFiles/xwzx/2026/8/202608201636152630.JPG" style="max-width: 100%; " title="202608201636152630.JPG" /></p><p><img src="/UploadFiles/xwzx/2026/8/202608201636159420.png" style="max-width: 100%; " title="202608201636159420.png" /></p><p><img src="/UploadFiles/xwzx/2026/8/202608201636156191.png" style="max-width: 100%; " title="202608201636156191.png" /></p><p style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;text-indent: 0.29in;"><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"></span>
</p><p style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;text-indent: 0.29in;"><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"><strong>启新程，筑梦想，青春扬帆向未来</strong></span></p><p style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;text-indent: 0.29in;"><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"></span></p><p><img src="/UploadFiles/xwzx/2026/8/202608201636279750.png" style="max-width: 100%; " title="202608201636279750.png" /></p><p><img src="/UploadFiles/xwzx/2026/8/202608201636266425.jpg" style="max-width: 100%; " title="202608201636266425.jpg" /></p><p style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;text-indent: 0.29in;"><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"></span>
</p><p style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;text-indent: 0.29in;"><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">本次始业教育启动仪式由德育处副主任马丹娜主持，她欢迎全体新学子迈入绍兴一中百年校园，希望全体新生以此为起点，整装启航，开启充实的高中三年。</span></p><p style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;text-indent: 0.29in;"><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"></span><img src="/UploadFiles/xwzx/2026/8/202608201636381710.png" style="max-width: 100%; " title="202608201636381710.png" /><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"></span></p><p style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;text-indent: 0.29in;"><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">仪式伊始，校党委副书记、校长蒋明发表致辞，对怀揣理想、奔赴一中的2026级新学子致以热烈的欢迎与诚挚的祝贺。</span><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">他</span><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">勉励同学们主动</span><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">调整</span><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">身心</span><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">状态</span><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">，培养良好行为习惯，快速融入全新的高中生活；</span><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">着力培养</span><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">深度思考能力，全面提升个人综合素养；更要立足时代、心怀家国，争做具备时代洞察力的思考者、拥有行动担当力的践行者，让青春理想与时代发展同频共振。</span></p><p style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;text-indent: 0.29in;"><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"></span><img src="/UploadFiles/xwzx/2026/8/202608201637148428.png" style="max-width: 100%; " title="202608201637148428.png" /><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"></span></p><p style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;text-indent: 0.29in;"><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">优秀高三毕业生</span><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">，</span><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">2026年绍兴市高考状元</span><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">俞毅恒</span><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">同学</span><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">作为学长代表分享成长心得与学习经验。他结合自身高中求学经历，鼓励学弟学妹们树立远大理想、保持积极平和的心态，正视高中学习的挑战与压力，掌握科学的学习方法，珍惜宝贵的高中时光，勇于突破自我、奋力逐梦前行，在一中的沃土上绽放青春光彩。</span></p><p style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;text-indent: 0.29in;"><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"></span><img src="/UploadFiles/xwzx/2026/8/202608201637252831.png" style="max-width: 100%; " title="202608201637252831.png" /><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"></span></p><p style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;text-indent: 0.29in;"><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">学校为各班学生代表隆重颁发录取通知书。一纸通知书，是学子们日夜耕耘的硕果，是青春逐梦的见证，更承载着学校对每一位新生的殷切期盼与美好祝福，正式开启同学们的高中求学之旅。</span></p><p style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;text-indent: 0.29in;"><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"></span></p><p><img src="/UploadFiles/xwzx/2026/8/202608201637404515.png" style="max-width: 100%; " title="202608201637404515.png" /></p><p><img src="/UploadFiles/xwzx/2026/8/202608201637416172.png" style="max-width: 100%; " title="202608201637416172.png" /></p><p><img src="/UploadFiles/xwzx/2026/8/202608201637419061.png" style="max-width: 100%; " title="202608201637419061.png" /></p><p style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;text-indent: 0.29in;"><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"></span>
</p><p style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;text-indent: 0.29in;"><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">入学仪式尾声，全体新生共同观看校史宣传片，了解学校的发展历程、办学初心、育人成果与优秀校友事迹。深厚的校园文脉、浓厚的治学氛围、砥砺奋进的校风和学风，让新生们深切感悟一中的精神底蕴。</span></p><p style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;text-indent: 0.29in;"><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"></span></p><p><img src="/UploadFiles/xwzx/2026/8/202608201637575678.png" style="max-width: 100%; " title="202608201637575678.png" /></p><p><img src="/UploadFiles/xwzx/2026/8/202608201637572016.png" style="max-width: 100%; " title="202608201637572016.png" /></p><p><img src="/UploadFiles/xwzx/2026/8/202608201637570907.png" style="max-width: 100%; " title="202608201637570907.png" /></p><p style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;text-indent: 0.29in;"><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"></span>
</p><p style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;text-indent: 0.29in;"><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">仪式落幕，游园启序。新生结伴漫步菁菁校园，寻访校园景致、熟悉求学环境、体悟校风学风，在轻松融洽的氛围中消解陌生、结识同窗，快速融入一中温暖的集体，为高中生活拉开美好序幕。</span></p><p style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;"><span style="font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"> </span></p><p style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;"><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"><strong>授方法，明路径，智慧领航助成长</strong></span></p><p style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;text-indent: 0.29in;"><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">初高中学习存在思维、模式、难度的多重跨越，为帮助新生顺利衔接过渡、找准高中学习方向、规避学习误区，学校专项开展高中学法指导专题讲座。</span></p><p style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;text-indent: 0.29in;"><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"></span><img src="/UploadFiles/xwzx/2026/8/202608201638083918.jpg" style="max-width: 100%; " title="202608201638083918.jpg" /><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"></span></p><p style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;text-indent: 0.29in;"><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">朱谷兰</span><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">老师立足初高中语文学习的核心差异，指出高中语文更注重文本深度解读、思辨思维培养、文化素养积淀与个性化表达，引导学生跳出浅层学习误区，深耕语文核心素养，在文字中感悟文化力量，提升人文底蕴。</span></p><p style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;text-indent: 0.29in;"><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"></span><img src="http://10.176.17.2/UploadFiles/xwzx/2026/8/202608201638311003.jpg" title="202608201638311003.jpg" style="font-family: Calibri; font-size: 14px; text-align: justify; text-indent: 27.84px; white-space: normal; max-width: 100%;" /><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"></span></p><p style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;text-indent: 0.29in;"><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">杨国平老师</span><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">聚焦理科思维转型难点</span><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">，</span><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">针对高中物理逻辑性强、综合性高的特点，</span><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">引</span><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">导新生学会构建物理模型、拆解题型逻辑、总结解题规律，注重实验探究与理论结合，夯实物理基础，培养严谨的理科思维，从容应对高中物理的学习挑战。</span></p><img src="/UploadFiles/xwzx/2026/8/202608201639025911.jpg" style="max-width: 100%; " title="202608201639025911.jpg" /><p style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;text-indent: 0.29in;"><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">依托学校特色与科创育人体系，卢燎亚</span><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">老师</span><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">为新生打开了探索宇宙的全新视野。</span><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">卢</span><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">老师介绍了国内天文院校发展情</span><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">况和人才缺口</span><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">，讲解了天文学与地理等学科的关联互通性。同时鼓励热爱星空的新生积极参与天文观测、科创竞赛等活动，保持探索未知的好奇心，发掘自身多元潜能</span><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">，</span><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">承担国家责任</span><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">。</span></p><p style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;text-indent: 0.29in;"><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">本次学法指导聚焦核心学科，立足初高中学习差异，为新生带来干货满满的指导，帮助同学们打破初高中学习壁垒，建立科学、高效、适配高中节奏的学习体系，为高中三年学业深耕筑牢坚实根基。</span></p><p style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;text-indent: 0.29in;"><span style="font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"> </span></p><p style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;"><span style="font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"> </span></p><p style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;"><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"><strong>聚家校，共携手，同心护航育新苗</strong></span></p><p style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;text-indent: 0.29in;"><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">教育无独行，家校共致远。</span><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">晚上</span><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">召开2026级新生专题家长会，全体新生家长齐聚校园，共话成长、共商育人、共筑未来。</span></p><p style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;text-indent: 0.29in;"><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"></span><img src="/UploadFiles/xwzx/2026/8/202608201639170039.png" style="max-width: 100%; " title="202608201639170039.png" /><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"></span></p><p style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;text-indent: 0.29in;"><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">会议伊始，蒋明校长向全体家长的信任与莅临表示诚挚感谢，全面介绍了学校百年办学底蕴、鲜明育人特色与丰硕办学成果。他指出，学校始终坚守“为学生适配发展”的育人理念，深耕品德塑造、学业培育、心理护航全方位育人体系。</span></p><p style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;text-indent: 0.29in;"><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"></span><img src="/UploadFiles/xwzx/2026/8/202608201639354808.JPG" style="max-width: 100%; " title="202608201639354808.JPG" /><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"></span></p><p style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;text-indent: 0.29in;"><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">冯王亮副校长与家长分享高中升学规划。他立足当下高考改革政策，细致解读多元升学相关细则。结合绍兴一中历年升学数据与真实案例，剖析各类升学渠道的适配人群、竞争优势、长期规划与阶段性准备重点，为家长们理清不同发展方向的培养思路，为家庭制定孩子升学规划提供了详实、可落地的实操指导。</span></p><p style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;text-indent: 0.29in;"><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"></span><img src="/UploadFiles/xwzx/2026/8/202608201639463526.jpg" style="max-width: 100%; " title="202608201639463526.jpg" /><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"></span></p><p style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;text-indent: 0.29in;"><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">专题讲座结束后，家校沟通进入分班交流环节。家长们有序移步至各班教室，与班主任开展一对一深度交流。班主任从作息管理、学科预习、阅读积累、心理疏导等方面，为家长提供暑期居家学习与生活管理的合理化建议，引导家长科学陪伴、适度引导，平稳助力孩子完成初高中过渡。</span></p><p style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;text-indent: 0.29in;"><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"></span></p><p><img src="/UploadFiles/xwzx/2026/8/202608201640189806.jpg" style="max-width: 100%; " title="202608201640189806.jpg" /></p><p><img src="/UploadFiles/xwzx/2026/8/202608201640175419.jpg" style="max-width: 100%; " title="202608201640175419.jpg" /></p><p><img src="/UploadFiles/xwzx/2026/8/202608201640170415.jpg" style="max-width: 100%; " title="202608201640170415.jpg" /></p><p><img src="/UploadFiles/xwzx/2026/8/202608201640188871.jpg" style="max-width: 100%; " title="202608201640188871.jpg" /></p><p><img src="/UploadFiles/xwzx/2026/8/202608201640195025.jpg" style="max-width: 100%; " title="202608201640195025.jpg" /></p><p><img src="/UploadFiles/xwzx/2026/8/202608201640184912.jpg" style="max-width: 100%; " title="202608201640184912.jpg" /></p><p><img src="/UploadFiles/xwzx/2026/8/202608201640194579.jpg" style="max-width: 100%; " title="202608201640194579.jpg" /></p><p><img src="/UploadFiles/xwzx/2026/8/202608201640207131.jpg" style="max-width: 100%; " title="202608201640207131.jpg" /></p><p><img src="/UploadFiles/xwzx/2026/8/202608201640198247.jpg" style="max-width: 100%; " title="202608201640198247.jpg" /></p><p><img src="/UploadFiles/xwzx/2026/8/202608201640192176.jpg" style="max-width: 100%; " title="202608201640192176.jpg" /></p><p><img src="/UploadFiles/xwzx/2026/8/202608201640208571.jpg" style="max-width: 100%; " title="202608201640208571.jpg" /></p><p style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;text-indent: 0.29in;"><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"></span>
</p><p style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;text-indent: 0.29in;"><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">百年学府育新人，薪火相传启新程。本次始业教育系列活动，以初心领航思想、以方法赋能学业、以同心守护成长，为2026级学子的高中生涯筑牢起步根基。愿全体新一中学子，承百年文脉，怀少年热忱，从优秀奔赴卓越，以笃行成就未来，在一中沃土书写属于自己的青春华章！</span></p><p style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;"><span style="font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"> </span></p>
    
